/* Actions: one Play pill (w - 36 - 64) x 52 and the 52 px "…" circle (DetailActionButtons.kt). The
   first tap on "…" only unfolds the row (`detail.actions: "expand"`, `data-expanded`): "…" turns 90
   degrees and turns white, and two 52 px circles slide in, 12 apart, shrinking Play to
   (w - 36 - 192): Save where Nuvio has Mark watched (izumi has no one-tap mark-watched for a series),
   then the list button as Nuvio's Library circle, a "+" that turns to a tick, white on dark, once
   the title is on a list. The list button is a header button (`detail.buttons: ["play", "list"]`)
   hidden on the page otherwise, because it is also the solid bar's +/✓ toggle, which Nuvio shows in
   every state (Save exists only while the row is unfolded). A second tap on "…" opens the menu with
